{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217920","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217920","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1321792001:0":{"text":"다... 당신은 조금 전 그 접견실에 있던 시녀!","source_cn":"你……你是刚才那个在会客室里的侍女！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC34316B8610CDB51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321792002:0":{"text":"접견실이요...? 제가 접견실에 갔었나요?","source_cn":"会客室……？我去过会客室吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9E9441BEF12EF25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321792003:1":{"text":"...아! 어렴풋이 생각이 나네요. 아주 즐거운 일이었던 것 같아요. 아니... 슬픈 일이었던가요?","source_cn":"……啊！好像模模糊糊有些印象，是很快乐的事情。不……是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD380B8090067485A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321792004:0":{"text":"아, 정말 이상하네요... 저 스스로도 무슨 생각을 하고 있는지 모른다니. 정말 죄송해요.","source_cn":"哎呀，真奇怪……我竟然搞不清楚自己到底在想什么，真是失礼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6770AF32FCB62014","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321792005:0":{"text":"환상이 사라지고 나니, 성 안의 사람들도 무슨 일이 있었는지는 잊어버리고 어렴풋한 기억만 남은 것 같네요.","source_cn":"看来幻境消失后，城堡里的人也忘记了发生的事呢，只留下一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F247D0207C7A490","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"",